  "content": "\n\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Title.png\">\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Overview.png\">\n<p></p>\n<center><p>此模組會變更遊戲中特定方塊的視覺效果，將原本通常具有軸向選取框的方塊改為傾斜選取框，使其與模型相符，並整體改善方塊的外觀。</p></center>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34ZhTuy.png\">\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://resourceful-bees.gitbook.io/resourceful-lib/highlights\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Wiki.png\"></a>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/resourcefulbees\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Discord.png\"></a>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/teamresourceful\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_BisectPromo.png\"></a>",
